      "name": "Kel-Tec KSG-12 Shotgun",
      "slug": "kel-tec-ksg-12-shotgun",
      "teaser": "Introduces KSG-12 to tarkov",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2309.png",
      "downloads": 29616,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p>The KSG-12 has come to tarkov</p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>KSG-12, a shotgun that can switch between left or right tube (dual tube system is not included with product). Boasting a large round capacity and it being a Kel-Tec product, <em>Unique</em> as one would say.</p>\n<p>Available at Peacekeeper LL1 &amp; 2 (Trade offers and Dollars)</p>\n<p>Requested by RaiRaiTheRaichu</p>\n<p>&lt;iframe width=“560” height=“315” src=“https://www.youtube.com/embed/huyVn_nVxqI?si=hwTd9Oe6O27OjAF1” title=“YouTube video player” frameborder=“0” allow=“accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share” referrerpolicy=“strict-origin-when-cross-origin” allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; Animation By Me</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/military/gun/kel-tec-ksg-bcfaa80f-78e9-48fa-b30a-0215fd0bdfe6\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Model</a> By <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.cgtrader.com/designers/sinki1295\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Sinki1295</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install Instruction</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>1. Download the Zip from the Gdrive</p>\n<p>2. Open the Zip</p>\n<p>3. Copy the content of the Zip your SPT folder</p>\n<p>4. Enjoy</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Some “Known” issues</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>There is a bit of a quirk with Shotguns in general and that is no inventory reload. So if you are reloading on inventory and it goes to idle instead of going back to inventory, that is perfectly normal, default BSG Behaviour.</p></div></div></div>\n<p>P.S Tarkov Shotguns are weird and probably broken in general</p>\n",
